Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.73,0:00:09.51,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,He still isn't awake yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.95,0:00:15.36,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,This whole thing is such a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.61,0:00:18.03,Flashback,Luna,0,0,0,,I will raise this child by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.03,0:00:20.54,Flashback,Luna,0,0,0,,I know that I can make \Nhim into a magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.81,0:00:25.55,Flashback,Bird Magician,0,0,0,,None of us have any idea when that boy \Nmay transform into The End of All Things.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.21,0:00:30.35,Flashback_Italics,Cat Witch,0,0,0,,I believe in Luna. I believe in her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.38,0:00:34.14,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Oh, I meant to ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.57,0:00:37.76,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,That Cat Witch that \Nappeared the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.76,0:00:39.41,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,She was a friend of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.38,0:02:24.60,Italics,Narr,0,0,0,,This story happened before the black \Ncat Sisi came to live in Luna's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.42,0:02:30.00,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Look. Isn't that her?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.56,0:02:36.90,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,EPISODE 5: I CANNOT RETURN\N TO THE CAT FOREST
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.00,0:02:32.47,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,The one who moved to the forest
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.47,0:02:35.01,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,and got a special exemption \Nto become a black witch?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.50,0:02:38.51,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,The Champignon Witch, Luna?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.99,0:02:45.68,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Ew, look! Everything she steps on or \Ntouches really does grow mushrooms!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.68,0:02:51.73,Flashback,Bat,0,0,0,,Hey, Dorothy! If we're here to spy on \Nher, could you at least keep it down?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.73,0:02:53.98,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Ew, that's so gross!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.98,0:02:56.19,Flashback,Bat,0,0,0,,Are you even listening to me, Dorothy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.19,0:02:59.87,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,You don't have to tell me, Bat Magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.87,0:03:03.16,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,We're here as representatives \Nof the black witches
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.16,0:03:06.73,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,to spy on the shady new girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.50,0:03:11.75,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Hey, hey! A real weirdo moved in nearby!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.75,0:03:14.73,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Imagine the nerve! Let's go find her!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.58,0:03:18.78,Flashback,Mouse,0,0,0,,How are we representatives \Nwhen nobody asked us to come?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.21,0:03:22.38,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,How about you shut up, Mouse Magician!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.38,0:03:23.69,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Hiss!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.53,0:03:27.12,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,SECOND-RATE BULLY
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.69,0:03:25.02,Flashback_Italics,Mouse (M),0,0,0,,I just wanna go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.62,0:03:27.12,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,PICKS ON THE WEAK
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.02,0:03:27.14,Flashback_Italics,Bat (M),0,0,0,,You're the one who needs to shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.14,0:03:32.35,Flashback_Italics,Dorothy (M),0,0,0,,We use our magic to help \Ncleanse this poisoned world
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.35,0:03:34.36,Flashback_Italics,Dorothy (M),0,0,0,,and protect it from behind the scenes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.87,0:03:38.23,Flashback_Italics,Dorothy (M),0,0,0,,We are proud black witches \Nand black magicians.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.66,0:03:39.69,Flashback,Mouse,0,0,0,,In training, you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.69,0:03:42.03,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,We'll be official soon enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.03,0:03:44.18,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,But that Champignon Witch,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.18,0:03:48.65,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,I heard she became a black witch \Nwith almost no real training.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.65,0:03:50.80,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,How was she able to pull that off?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.80,0:03:52.29,Flashback,Bat,0,0,0,,You're just jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.29,0:03:54.74,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,It's way too fishy to be legit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.74,0:03:58.60,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,And just look at that! She's \Nalready noticed we're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.22,0:04:03.10,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Dang it! All because you guys couldn't \Nkeep your mouths shut! Get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.10,0:04:06.26,Flashback,Bat/Mouse,0,0,0,,You're the one who's been \Ndoing all the yapping.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.68,0:04:11.74,Flashback,Mouse,0,0,0,,I wonder if all the rumors are true.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.74,0:04:12.87,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Rumors?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.98,0:04:17.30,Flashback,Mouse,0,0,0,,About her. That she used \Nto be a cursed youngling.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.30,0:04:17.79,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.79,0:04:19.48,Flashback,Mouse,0,0,0,,Thanks to the magic she was born with,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.48,0:04:22.03,Flashback,Mouse,0,0,0,,she didn't become The End of All Things.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.03,0:04:23.82,Flashback_Italics,Dorothy (M),0,0,0,,She was a cursed youngling?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.33,0:04:27.39,Flashback,Mouse,0,0,0,,It made her breath and body poisonous.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.39,0:04:30.58,Flashback,Mouse,0,0,0,,The mushrooms she grows \Nare all poisonous, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.58,0:04:36.51,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Ew! That's so nasty! Gross! \NWhy is she even here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.84,0:04:36.51,Flashback,Mouse,0,0,0,,{\an8}Shh! Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.51,0:04:39.25,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,{\an8}Mmfh! Mmph!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.22,0:04:45.26,Flashback,Bat,0,0,0,,Hey, our cover is so far blown, I \Nthink she's started making tea for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.65,0:04:54.15,Flashback_Italics,Dorothy (M),0,0,0,,This is a disaster. To think that such \Na creepy girl is a black witch like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.15,0:04:56.41,Flashback_Italics,Dorothy (M),0,0,0,,She's gonna give all of us \Nblack witches a bad name!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.94,0:05:02.23,Flashback_Italics,Dorothy (M),0,0,0,,We have nothing to do with her, but the \Nhumans aren't gonna know the difference!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.40,0:05:09.07,Flashback,Bat,0,0,0,,Well, I heard our master, the Beast \NMagician, is taking good care of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.32,0:05:12.65,Flashback,Bat,0,0,0,,Maybe we could also be... \Nuh, maybe not {\i1}friendly{\i0},
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.65,0:05:15.34,Flashback,Bat,0,0,0,,but why don't we back off \Nand give her some space?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.65,0:05:19.21,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,What did you just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.50,0:05:21.96,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,She gets tons of attention only \Nbecause she's such a pain in the neck,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.96,0:05:23.90,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,and gets private lessons from our master \Nwhen she's not even his apprentice?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.90,0:05:27.68,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,She's backed our poor master into a corner\N where he has to waste all his time
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.68,0:05:31.23,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,rehabilitating this delinquent instead \Nof tutoring his top students?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.23,0:05:33.13,Flashback_Italics,Mouse (M),0,0,0,,Jealousy, check. Resentment, check.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.13,0:05:35.23,Flashback_Italics,Bat (M),0,0,0,,Talk about biased commentary.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.52,0:05:40.73,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,She's unbelievable. I'll never \Nforgive her for this, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.73,0:05:44.17,Flashback,Mouse,0,0,0,,Why'd you have to bring \Nup the master, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.17,0:05:45.01,Flashback,Bat,0,0,0,,My bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.08,0:05:56.17,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,That's no way to serve tea to a guest! \NWhere the hell are your manners?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.58,0:06:00.46,Flashback_Italics,Dorothy (M),0,0,0,,I'll bully her until she runs crying \Nfrom the black witch community!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.84,0:06:11.79,Flashback_Italics,Dorothy (M),0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.59,0:06:14.47,Flashback_Italics,Dorothy (M),0,0,0,,How did we end up in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.10,0:06:19.60,Flashback_Italics,Bat (M),0,0,0,,You're the one who doesn't \Nhave any manners.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.60,0:06:24.90,Flashback,Minos,0,0,0,,Isn't this great, Luna? I know you said \Nyou wanted try a tea party for once,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.90,0:06:28.52,Flashback,Minos,0,0,0,,just like the one you read about \Nin that book the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.41,0:06:30.30,Flashback_Italics,Dorothy (M),0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.26,0:06:35.73,Flashback_Italics,Dorothy (M),0,0,0,,Oops. I'm not gonna let something \Nlike that make me lower my guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.42,0:06:41.25,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,You baked these with those \Npoison hands of yours, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.25,0:06:44.33,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Scary! There's no way I could eat one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.33,0:06:46.38,Flashback_Italics,Bat (M),0,0,0,,Wow, she's terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.38,0:06:50.01,Flashback,Merino,0,0,0,,Isn't this great, Luna? Finally, \Na chance to talk to people!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.01,0:06:51.63,Flashback,Merino,0,0,0,,Come on, don't be shy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.28,0:06:54.07,Flashback_Italics,Dorothy (M),0,0,0,,Uh, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.07,0:06:57.82,Flashback,Merino,0,0,0,,Nobody was even willing to \Nget close to you before!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.92,0:07:02.78,Flashback_Italics,Dorothy/Bat/Mouse,0,0,0,,She must be so miserable she can't \Neven tell when she's being picked on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.78,0:07:07.90,Flashback,Minos,0,0,0,,She didn't touch the cookies with her \Nbare hands, so they're okay to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.35,0:07:10.98,Flashback,Merino,0,0,0,,We're even learning about \Ngood manners today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.53,0:07:17.66,Flashback,Minos,0,0,0,,Aren't you glad our first \Nguests are such nice people?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.66,0:07:20.42,Flashback,Minos,0,0,0,,This is such a wonderful day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.84,0:07:23.78,Flashback,Minos,0,0,0,,You know, I could eat \Nthis for you if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.91,0:07:33.33,Italics,Narr,0,0,0,,The Cat Witch was perplexed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.68,0:07:36.68,Italics,Narr,0,0,0,,You could say that her toxic \Nattitude had been washed away,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.97,0:07:39.93,Italics,Narr,0,0,0,,defenseless against this \Nsudden shower of goodwill.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.37,0:07:43.16,Italics,Narr,0,0,0,,The cruelty she was so used to flaunting
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.16,0:07:45.19,Italics,Narr,0,0,0,,could not find suitable footing
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.59,0:07:50.19,Italics,Narr,0,0,0,,in an atmosphere drenched with such \Na profound sense of loneliness,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.60,0:07:54.36,Italics,Narr,0,0,0,,and that seemed to have \Nthrown her off her game...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.61,0:08:00.20,Italics,Narr,0,0,0,,especially because she had \Nnever once associated herself
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.20,0:08:03.39,Italics,Narr,0,0,0,,with the words "nice people" \Nbefore in her life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.21,0:08:06.94,Flashback,A,0,0,0,,Here comes that black witch again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.94,0:08:09.92,Flashback,B,0,0,0,,She goes around feeding all \Nthose thieving stray cats.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.92,0:08:12.07,Flashback,B,0,0,0,,They're so noisy at night!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.07,0:08:15.93,Flashback,C,0,0,0,,She isn't even helping us \Nget rid of all the mice!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.86,0:08:21.35,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,That's all your fault, you know! \NI had to cut back on the mousetraps
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.35,0:08:23.44,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,with you around, so now I get blamed!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.44,0:08:25.40,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Grr.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.44,0:08:27.99,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hiss!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.11,0:08:30.46,Flashback,Bat,0,0,0,,What's he gonna do? It's not like \Nhe can do his job without familiars.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.85,0:08:35.69,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,And we can't do our job gathering info \Nif we don't get along with the townsfolk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.69,0:08:37.18,Flashback,Mouse,0,0,0,,Thanks for being so considerate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.91,0:08:39.47,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,It's hard enough here already,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.47,0:08:42.96,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,where black witches have \Nsuch a bad reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.96,0:08:44.06,Flashback,Bat,0,0,0,,Hey. Isn't that...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.65,0:08:54.22,Flashback,Bookseller,0,0,0,,So you must be the mushroom \Nwitch I keep hearing about.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.67,0:08:57.03,Flashback,Bookseller,0,0,0,,Recently I have noticed a suspi... uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.03,0:09:00.22,Flashback,Bookseller,0,0,0,,a very inquisitive-looking person\N passing by the store.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.76,0:09:03.78,Flashback,Bookseller,0,0,0,,So you were friends with \Nthe Cat Witch all along?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.42,0:09:06.73,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,I wouldn't say we're friends or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.24,0:09:09.73,Flashback,Bookseller,0,0,0,,She is a little hard to \Nget along with, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.10,0:09:12.18,Flashback,Bookseller,0,0,0,,Has she been picking on you at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.69,0:09:13.74,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Hiss!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.10,0:09:17.44,Flashback,Bookseller,0,0,0,,It's your own fault! Ow, ow, ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.44,0:09:19.32,Flashback,Luna,0,0,0,,She isn't like that at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.26,0:09:21.39,Flashback,Bat/Mouse,0,0,0,,She talks!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.39,0:09:22.24,Flashback,Bookseller,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.57,0:09:24.75,Flashback,Luna,0,0,0,,She is a wonderful individual.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.31,0:09:29.80,Flashback,Luna,0,0,0,,Thanks to her, I finally got \Nto visit this bookstore today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.15,0:09:34.99,Flashback,Luna,0,0,0,,She keeps doing nice things for me. \NI think she is a very kind person.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.23,0:09:42.59,Flashback,Bookseller,0,0,0,,Huh. "Kind" isn't a word that comes \Nto mind when I think of the Cat Witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.02,0:09:47.24,Italics,Narr,0,0,0,,Starting around then, whenever the \NCat Witch was showered in compliments
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.24,0:09:50.23,Italics,Narr,0,0,0,,such as "kind" or "nice,"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.76,0:09:52.93,Italics,Narr,0,0,0,,she'd get a blissful \Nexpression on her face,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.93,0:09:56.81,Italics,Narr,0,0,0,,as if she was under some kind of spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.74,0:10:00.86,Italics,Narr,0,0,0,,In time, she started to visit \Nthe mushroom house more often
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.28,0:10:05.07,Italics,Narr,0,0,0,,in order to get another helping of \Nthis new and still unfamiliar feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.47,0:10:10.54,Flashback,Merino,0,0,0,,Luna, aren't you glad she's lending \Nyou the book you wanted to read?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.00,0:10:15.87,Flashback,Minos,0,0,0,,The birds in town were singing, "the \NCat Witch has a twisted, evil soul,"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.87,0:10:18.22,Flashback,Minos,0,0,0,,but that isn't true at all, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.22,0:10:21.53,Flashback,Minos,0,0,0,,She's a kind witch, and she's been \Ncoming to visit us a bunch recently,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.53,0:10:24.06,Flashback,Minos,0,0,0,,so every day has been lots of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.42,0:10:26.98,Italics,Narr,0,0,0,,It was as if these \Nunadulterated showers of praise
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.98,0:10:31.50,Italics,Narr,0,0,0,,yanked the teeth out of \Nthe witch's cruel bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.91,0:11:01.43,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Sure, Luna has a poison body because \Nshe was once a cursed youngling,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.43,0:11:05.31,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,but it's also because she absorbs \Nand cleans poison from the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.31,0:11:06.43,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Did you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.43,0:11:11.44,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,All these people who talk trash about \Nher don't even care. It's unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.80,0:11:15.44,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,They're the worst! They don't\Neven try to get to know her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.44,0:11:19.07,Flashback,Bat,0,0,0,,She should try saying all \Nthis to her old self.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.07,0:11:22.58,Flashback,Mouse,0,0,0,,She's more likely to cast a spell \Nto forget her bad behavior.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.92,0:11:29.21,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Before, all the trees and animals of this \Nblack forest were contaminated with poison
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.21,0:11:32.13,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,and it was home to all sorts \Nof pests and evil spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.13,0:11:34.00,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,But once you moved here,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.00,0:11:37.06,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,it changed from a black forest \Nto a poison mushroom forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.06,0:11:39.67,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,I can feel safe letting \Nmy cats play here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.29,0:11:44.55,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Hey, it sounds kind of impersonal \Nwhen you call me "Miss Dorothy."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.55,0:11:46.47,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Just call me "Dorothy" \Nas if I was your sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.78,0:11:48.97,Flashback_Italics,Bat (M),0,0,0,,Well, that came out of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.22,0:11:55.44,Flashback,Luna,0,0,0,,Um... Dor... Sis... Miss Witch? Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.44,0:11:58.98,Flashback,Mouse,0,0,0,,Yeah, this is what happens with someone \Nwho's not comfortable with people.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.42,0:12:02.49,Flashback,Luna,0,0,0,,Can you tell me why you decided \Nto become a cat witch?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.64,0:12:07.39,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,It's simple. Obviously \Nbecause I love cats so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.39,0:12:09.72,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Wasn't it the same for you,\N with mushrooms?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.21,0:12:15.61,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,This is such a nice place, \Nthough. But did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.61,0:12:19.13,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,They say there's also a legendary \Ncat forest that only cats live in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.78,0:12:24.51,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Sometimes, the more distinguished cat \Nwitches even get invitations to visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.51,0:12:26.01,Flashback_Italics,Luna (M),0,0,0,,A cat forest...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.71,0:12:31.31,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,I really want to go see it myself, but \NI guess because I'm still inexperienced,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.31,0:12:34.02,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,the forest's chief won't\N give me permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.41,0:12:37.70,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Shucks, why am I not good enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.70,0:12:41.79,Flashback,Elder,0,0,0,,Dorothy? Not her. Furr-get it. \NShe's hiss-terically loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.79,0:12:44.76,Flashback,Elder,0,0,0,,She's a blabber-meowth. A real purr-oblem.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.37,0:12:45.18,Flashback,Sisi,0,0,0,,{\an8}I see what you mean meow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.18,0:12:51.32,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,But I can imagine what it's like \Nfrom what these guys have told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.32,0:12:53.04,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Almost like I've been there before.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.61,0:12:58.02,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,In fact, I bet I used to live \Nthere as a cat in a past life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.02,0:13:01.55,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Still, I hope I can visit\N the cat forest soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.55,0:13:03.19,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,You know what my dream in life is?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.19,0:13:08.77,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,It's to put this silly, poisoned world \Nbehind me, move to the cat forest
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.77,0:13:13.08,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,where nobody hassles me and \NI can be with the cats I love
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.08,0:13:16.06,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,and live there happily ever after.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.77,0:13:21.42,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Well, that was what I always wanted, \Nuntil I met this Champignon Witch,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.42,0:13:24.89,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,who fights so bravely to \Nrid the world of poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.38,0:13:28.59,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Now that I've seen how pretty \Nthe black forest has become,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.59,0:13:31.20,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,as your big sister and \Nsenior as a black witch,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.20,0:13:33.58,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,I can see I still have \Na lot of work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.05,0:13:38.74,Italics,Narr,0,0,0,,The cat forest. A homeland \Nshe has not yet seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.58,0:13:39.46,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,{\an8}That said, our job is actually espionage.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.46,0:13:40.76,Flashback,Luna,0,0,0,,{\an8}Espionage?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.46,0:13:43.03,Italics,Narr,0,0,0,,But she cannot return to \Nthe cat forest just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.76,0:13:47.18,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,{\an8}Cats aren't poisonous animals, so instead \Nof purifying like poison witches...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.24,0:13:52.31,Flashback,Cat 1,0,0,0,,Dorothy, the tabby who got \Ninto the white witch's castle
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.31,0:13:54.18,Flashback,Cat 1,0,0,0,,has been missing for two days meow!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.18,0:13:55.80,Flashback,Cat 2,0,0,0,,I bet mew they caught her!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.80,0:13:57.74,Flashback,Cat 3,0,0,0,,How many does that make meow?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.74,0:13:58.94,Flashback,Cat 1,0,0,0,,What meow?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.94,0:14:00.81,Flashback,Cat 3,0,0,0,,Now what do we mew?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.25,0:14:07.82,Flashback,Sisi,0,0,0,,The tabby's dead fur sure! There's \Nno point trying to save him meow!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.82,0:14:09.57,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,We don't know for sure yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.57,0:14:12.58,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,But either way, if they \Nsuspect us of spying now,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.58,0:14:16.33,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,all of the cats and I are \Nin danger of being purged!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.33,0:14:21.64,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,There's also several black witches in the \Ncastle who are being unjustly detained!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.34,0:14:24.97,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Sisi, you guys need to get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.97,0:14:28.43,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Go tell the master and our \Nfriends what's happening here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.51,0:14:32.32,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,I'll use the confusion \Nto sneak into the castle,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.32,0:14:37.18,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,rescue the tabby and other cats, and give\N the white witches a little surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.02,0:14:40.85,Flashback,Sisi,0,0,0,,No, Dorothy! It's too dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.85,0:14:43.40,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,I need to distract them \Nso everyone can get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.77,0:14:47.47,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,I'll be all right, Sisi. I'm not afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.91,0:14:49.86,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,When I remember what she said...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.86,0:14:51.40,Flashback_Italics,Luna,0,0,0,,She is a very kind person.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.40,0:14:55.21,Flashback_Italics,Dorothy,0,0,0,,It makes me want to live up to\N those words, and protect everyone I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.31,0:14:59.62,Flashback_Italics,Dorothy (M),0,0,0,,I want to collect every bit\N of this strange feeling,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.93,0:15:03.56,Flashback_Italics,Dorothy (M),0,0,0,,and clutch it tight, close to my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.46,0:15:10.36,Flashback_Italics,Dorothy (M),0,0,0,,I don't want to return to the cat forest \Nuntil I've truly become that person.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.74,0:15:43.59,Flashback,Mouse,0,0,0,,This is the town square where \NDorothy was executed the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.00,0:15:48.09,Flashback,Mouse,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming, Champignon Witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.68,0:15:51.01,Flashback,Luna,0,0,0,,Mouse Magician...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.01,0:15:54.59,Flashback,Mouse,0,0,0,,Sorry to show up like this, \Nbut I need to stay undercover.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.59,0:16:12.61,Flashback_Italics,Luna (M),0,0,0,,The ground here is stained \Nwith the Cat Witch's
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.61,0:16:18.06,Flashback_Italics,Luna (M),0,0,0,,grief mushroom, pain mushroom,\N anger mushroom,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.79,0:16:24.07,Flashback_Italics,Luna (M),0,0,0,,fear mushroom, misery mushroom, \Nsolitude mushroom...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.62,0:16:32.55,Flashback,Mouse,0,0,0,,Look, Sisi. All of Dorothy's pain is \Ngrowing into mushrooms to be cleansed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.13,0:16:47.91,Flashback,Luna,0,0,0,,Kindness mushrooms?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.62,0:16:57.96,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Oh, come on. Stop crying, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.91,0:17:02.12,Flashback,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Bye now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.42,0:17:14.42,Flashback,Minos,0,0,0,,Luna, these guys are saying that\N the Cat Witch is in the cat forest now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.83,0:17:30.25,Flashback_Italics,Dorothy,0,0,0,,I believe in Luna.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.37,0:17:32.61,Flashback_Italics,Dorothy,0,0,0,,I believe in her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.11,0:17:48.84,Italics,Queen's Voice,0,0,0,,My darling Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.39,0:17:58.54,Italics,Queen's Voice,0,0,0,,Please, hurry and die for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.47,0:18:03.62,Italics,Queen's Voice,0,0,0,,You will never be allowed \Nto be reborn again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.98,0:18:07.50,Italics,Queen's Voice,0,0,0,,For the sake of this country,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.31,0:18:11.69,Italics,Queen's Voice,0,0,0,,indeed, for the sake of this world...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.42,0:18:28.75,Default,Queen,0,0,0,,You are the one who should \Nnever have been born.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.40,0:18:35.00,Default,Queen,0,0,0,,Eliminating you is a duty\N I inherited from my late sister,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.00,0:18:36.38,Default,Queen,0,0,0,,who left you in my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.75,0:18:42.21,Default,Queen,0,0,0,,If it is any consolation, I shall \Nallow you to pass on in ignorance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.48,0:18:47.27,Default,Lizel,0,0,0,,Mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.34,0:18:52.52,Italics,Lizel (M),0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.55,0:18:54.90,Italics,Lizel (M),0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.83,0:19:06.70,Italics,Lizel (M),0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.41,0:19:13.35,Italics,Lizel (M),0,0,0,,Somebody is draining my memories... \Nall of the agony from my body?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.44,0:19:20.41,Italics,Lizel (M),0,0,0,,Painful memories, depressing \Nexperiences, dark feelings,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.05,0:19:26.68,Italics,Lizel (M),0,0,0,,whirlpools of uncertainty, constellations \Nof suffering, flashbacks of fear,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.17,0:19:29.29,Italics,Lizel (M),0,0,0,,and everything illuminated within.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.11,0:19:37.08,Italics,Lizel (M),0,0,0,,Wait, if you take all of that away, \NI'll barely have any memories left.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.45,0:19:43.11,Italics,Lizel (M),0,0,0,,I see. I suppose this shows
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.95,0:19:49.43,Italics,Lizel (M),0,0,0,,just how deeply my path in life \Nhas been stained by sadness.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.92,0:19:52.15,Italics,Lizel (M),0,0,0,,It's actually beautiful...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.96,0:19:58.09,Italics,Lizel (M),0,0,0,,the light cast by the sadness \Nas it flows away from my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.34,0:20:01.30,Italics,Lizel (M),0,0,0,,No, come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.46,0:20:14.26,Italics,Lizel (M),0,0,0,,I cannot allow myself to forget \Nthis one precious memory
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.46,0:20:17.11,Italics,Lizel (M),0,0,0,,of the promise I made
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.23,0:20:19.62,Italics,Lizel (M),0,0,0,,to my late mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.13,0:20:24.81,Flashback,Mother,0,0,0,,Noah, Noël, Emile...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.19,0:20:29.29,Flashback,Mother,0,0,0,,you have multiple names.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.16,0:20:33.58,Flashback,Mother,0,0,0,,He who is destined to be king
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.99,0:20:36.90,Flashback,Mother,0,0,0,,must alternate between many \Npseudonyms throughout his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.21,0:20:42.07,Flashback,Mother,0,0,0,,You absolutely must not reveal \Nyour true name to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.16,0:20:47.72,Flashback,Mother,0,0,0,,Revealing your true name \Nwould expose you to a curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.72,0:20:53.46,Flashback,Mother,0,0,0,,When a king reveals his true name, it \Nimmediately compromises the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.74,0:20:59.30,Flashback,Mother,0,0,0,,When the throne is unstable, it sends \Nthe country into darkness and confusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.23,0:21:04.03,Flashback,Mother,0,0,0,,You must only recite your true \Nname silently, in your mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.68,0:21:06.49,Flashback,Mother,0,0,0,,when you need to use your magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.25,0:21:11.18,Flashback,Mother,0,0,0,,No matter the curse, if it \Nknows not your true name,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.71,0:21:16.53,Flashback,Mother,0,0,0,,it can never pose a mortal threat to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.26,0:21:22.83,Flashback,Mother,0,0,0,,This true name that I have given you is \None thing that you must never forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.76,0:21:26.46,Flashback,Mother,0,0,0,,Lock it tightly within your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.82,0:21:29.32,Flashback,Mother,0,0,0,,Your name is...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.74,0:21:39.02,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Luna! He just woke up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.02,0:21:42.65,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Hey, who are you? Hey, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.42,0:21:46.77,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Look, you know what you have to do, Luna.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.55,0:21:50.76,Italics,Lizel (M),0,0,0,,What? This is my body?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.54,0:21:55.32,Italics,Lizel (M),0,0,0,,Was it always this small?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.70,0:22:00.90,Italics,Lizel (M),0,0,0,,What was I like before this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.05,0:22:07.71,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,These first moments are crucial. If you \Ncan't make this kid into a magician,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.38,0:22:10.47,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,he's going to be put down.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.88,0:22:15.27,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,So set your feelings aside \Nand don't cut him any slack.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.94,0:22:20.66,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,You. Tell us your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.94,0:22:25.25,Flashback_Italics,Mother,0,0,0,,You must never forget
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.45,0:22:27.88,Flashback_Italics,Mother,0,0,0,,that your name is...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.33,0:22:34.28,Default,Lizel,0,0,0,,Lizel.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.18,0:22:34.10,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,LIZEL
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.99,0:22:38.12,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,TRANSLATION: MICHAEL ARNOLD
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.29,0:22:41.38,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,SUBTITLE TIMING: ANDY ELLIS\NEDITING: ELISABETH CRIST
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.71,0:22:46.09,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,QUALITY CHECK: GABRIELLA ALABANZA\NTRANSLATION CHECK: MICHELLE TYMON
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.56,0:24:10.25,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,NEXT TIME: THE FIRST DAY
